      "content": "Sorry to hear you're struggling with sleep. Turning to multiple medications to help you sleep, especially combining different central nervous system depressants, can be very dangerous. It's not advisable to consume Xanax that you already have on hand. I strongly recommend discussing this with your doctor — they can provide safer solutions that adhere to professional medical guidance. Please do not resort to mixing medications on your own.",
