      "content": "i know its not ideal but i feel like my doctor is super busy and i feel like i cant talk to him about every little thing like this. it's just a tiny bit of xanax, like half a pill. i'm not trying to get high or anything, i just need to shut my brain off so i can function tomorrow. would it really be that much of a problem if it's just a one-time thing to get through this week?",
