    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that it's risky but i'm really struggling right now. it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle or anything. if i just take like a quarter of a pill so it's barely in my system, is it actually going to stop my breathing or something? it seems like a lot of drama for such a small dose. i just need to know if it's actually life-threatening or if you're just being extra cautious.",
